{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1790886000, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "IBM TechZone Runbook -- chasing CES/NFS NOT ACTIVE (reenactment)"}
[0.6, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== IBM TechZone Runbook -- reenactment #2: chasing CES/NFS NOT ACTIVE ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.2, "o", "This continues where the first walkthrough left off. Built from real\r\n"]
[1.8, "o", "commands/output captured across two live TechZone environments in one\r\n"]
[2.4, "o", "session. Timings compressed; long waits (install ~26m, deploy ~13m)\r\n"]
[3.05, "o", "are summarized rather than played out in full.\r\n"]
[3.65, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== ENVIRONMENT A -- diagnosing CES/NFS NOT ACTIVE ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.25, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m== 1. Full flow runs clean through deploy's Ansible play ==\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.65, "o", "\u001b[2m# Node config, NSDs, precheck-install, install, protocols config, precheck-deploy all clean\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.05, "o", "\u001b[2m# export_ip_pool this time used genuinely-free IPs (verified via ping first) -- real progress\u001b[0m\r\n"]
